    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A First-Person Mystery Horror Set in an Abandoned School  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you uncover the truth behind the incident as you explore?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145520/extras/04e9fbe203a732303925c183f128a82a.avif?t=1730347259\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s something lurking in the school at night...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, a newly hired teacher, is about to head home after a long day when they stumble upon an old talisman. The moment they remove it, the school transforms into an abandoned ruin, and a strange, time-frozen world envelops them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This forsaken school hides terrifying secrets from the past, with restless spirits wandering its halls, guarding those secrets.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist must confront their fears and uncover the dark truth of what really happened here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ghosts Think They're Just Playing...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you\u2019ll encounter various paranormal phenomena. Uncover the cause of each and find a way to deal with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different endings await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time 1-3 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Streaming is allowed without any prior permission, whether by individuals or organizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It would be appreciated if you could include a link to the Steam page in your video description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- We are not responsible for any damages that may result from streaming this game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A First-Person Mystery Horror Set in an Abandoned School  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you uncover the truth behind the incident as you explore?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3145520/extras/04e9fbe203a732303925c183f128a82a.avif?t=1730347259\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s something lurking in the school at night...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, a newly hired teacher, is about to head home after a long day when they stumble upon an old talisman. The moment they remove it, the school transforms into an abandoned ruin, and a strange, time-frozen world envelops them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This forsaken school hides terrifying secrets from the past, with restless spirits wandering its halls, guarding those secrets.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist must confront their fears and uncover the dark truth of what really happened here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Ghosts Think They're Just Playing...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you\u2019ll encounter various paranormal phenomena. Uncover the cause of each and find a way to deal with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different endings await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time 1-3 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Streaming is allowed without any prior permission, whether by individuals or organizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- It would be appreciated if you could include a link to the Steam page in your video description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- We are not responsible for any damages that may result from streaming this game.</p>",
